# ============================================================================
#  Local environment template for CrossySdkUnrealSamp.
#
#  This file is OPTIONAL. The plugin install scripts work out of the box
#  against the public registry repo (`to-nexus/crossy-sdk-unreal-sample`)
#  without any authentication.
#
#  Copy to `.env` and fill in only if you actually need it. `.env` is
#  .gitignore'd and is auto-loaded by the Makefile.
#
#    cp .env.example .env
#    # edit .env if needed
#    make sdk-install
# ============================================================================

# GITHUB_TOKEN — OPTIONAL.
#
# When unset, install-plugins.{sh,ps1} talks to the GitHub REST API
# anonymously, which is fine for individual machines (60 requests/hour
# anonymous quota is more than enough for `make sdk-install`).
#
# Set this only if:
#   • you hit "API rate limit exceeded" on a shared CI runner, OR
#   • you switch the registry to a private repo (advanced, not the default).
#
# Any GitHub PAT works — public repos require no specific scopes.
#GITHUB_TOKEN=
